4 consensus config_* (both members equal), 4 `optimized_config_*`. NEW routing\nwrinkle: id tags are WORDS (`optimized`/`unoptimized`) while basenames carry `O3`/`O0` -- the question's \"basename ends O3.elf\"\nroutes. Theme unasked (trace family `freebasic_optimization_variant_trace`/`semantic_equivalence_only`). CORRECT T+1:20, 0 wrong;\nTT 3.0 s / Mastery 13 sets (5278 ids) 5.7 s first POST.\n**D30 \"Campaign Trail\" (campaign-graph)** = Haxe 4.3.7 -> NEKO bytecode TRIO `d30--sample-loader.n`/`-library.n`/`-config.n`\n(archive order = load order; ~20.9 KB each; the D19 enum token `neko_bytecode` finally shipped, accepted first try). No HCFG: each\nmember ENDS with a RAW `HGRF` record (same 12-byte HCFG layout, ver 1, xor key, ~695 B) holding `huntress.binary.campaign_graph.v1`\n{campaign_id `DAY30-000`, nodes, edges `loader.n->library.n`/`library.n->config.n`, load_order, config{campaign, domain, ipv4, url,\nmutex, windows_path, linux_path, service, host_model}, this_role, network none, effects `isolated_multi_process_event_graph_only`}.\nPrompt: \"One binary is a clue; a campaign is a story. Reconstruct the loader, library, and config graph across the whole set and\nmap the operation end to end.\" 420 ids = 406 + 14: 3 sha256, `loader_`/`library_`/`config_capsule_` format (tag `config_capsule`\n-> basename `config.n`), 4 consensus config_* (\"Use loader.n's decoded HGRF graph.config object after confirming all three\ncanonical campaign graphs match when this_role is omitted\"), 4 `config_capsule_graph_config_*`. JSON path `graph.config.X`: the\ntop level has no `graph` key (it names the record). Graph structure (nodes/edges/load_order) UNASKED. CORRECT T+1:18 (10 rejected\n`none` placeholder probes from the race harness, no real wrong answer); TT 3.1 s / Mastery 14 sets (5880 ids) 6.1 s first POST.\n**D30 bonus \"SHA1-Hulud\"** (separate slug, one `flag` answer, 3 wrong max, per-team build; organizers: Day-30 only): hardened\nRust PE64 crackme -- self-SHA-1 of `